{"id":"8b50de0d408d2a30","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md","title":"ZFC Rel Rank Function","display":"df-zfc-rel-rank-function — ZFC Rel Rank Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-rank-function — ZFC Rel Rank Function","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-well-founded-relation.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-rank-function — ZFC Rel Rank Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6e2250a95e86cd5\" href=\"?note=a6e2250a95e86cd5\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-well-founded-relation.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-well-founded-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R,\\rho\\in V\">\\(X,R,\\rho\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (notions from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S(\\rho,R,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S(R,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,X,\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho))\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\n\\rho(x)=\n\\bigcup\\left\\{\n\\rho(y)\\cup\\{\\rho(y)\\}:\ny\\in X\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\n\\right\\}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S(\\rho,R,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S(R,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,X,\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho))\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\n\\rho(x)=\n\\bigcup\\left\\{\n\\rho(y)\\cup\\{\\rho(y)\\}:\ny\\in X\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\n\\right\\}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Well-foundedness and the ordinal codomain are prerequisites for the\nrecursion; the supremum of the empty predecessor set is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-well-founded-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"a6e2250a95e86cd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-rel-well-founded-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,R,\\rho\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S(\\rho,R,X)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S(R,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,X,\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho))\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\n\\rho(x)=\n\\bigcup\\left\\{\n\\rho(y)\\cup\\{\\rho(y)\\}:\ny\\in X\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\n\\right\\}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":1286,"backlinks":[{"id":"3f5a5d2316370c0b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelRankFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (rank-function predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function.md|58-df-zfc-rel-rank-function]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a6e2250a95e86cd5","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2"]}